    "description": "The unlocked potential of ageing and Silver Economy in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/the-unlocked-potential-of-ageing-and-silver-economy-in-sri-lanka/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
