    "md5": "c07ed672bd2b70d26bcdad1e8eae093e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1992,
    "chunk_text": "Some analysts view the election as a triangular tussle between the DMK led alliance,the AIADMK alliance and Vijay\u2019s TVK. Seemaan\u2019s NTK is not taken into account by these analysts despite the fact that the party polled 8% of the votes ib the  2021 poll and came third.\n\nThough well established political parties who have been doing politics for many years and senior political leaders with great political experience are facing the hustings,it is the novice Vijay and his fledgling TVP who are basking  most in the media limelight. This is due to two reasons.One is the filmstar\u2019s personal popularity. The other is the yearning among sections of the people for an end to 59 years of Dravidian party rule in the state. Whatever the final outcome  of the April 23rd poll, there is no denying that Vijay\u2019s political  entry  and the  launching of the  TVK  has  brightened the political skies of Tamil Nadu.\n\nJoseph Vijay Chandrasekhar known to the world at large as Vijay is arguably the current  super star of Tamil cinema/. Although stylish veteran actor Rajinikanth has been acknowledged for long as Tamil cinema\u2019s solitary super star, that position  seems to have changed in recent times. In terms of popularity and marketability, Vijay who celebrated his 51st birthday last year on 22nd June is way above Rajini who celebrated his 75th birthday last year on  December 12th.\n\nVijay\u2019s parents are the well-known film director SA Chandrasekhar and the reputed singer Shobha Chandrasekhar.Vijay who has a huge fan following in Sri Lanka is married to a Sri Lankan Tamil woman hailing from Chuzhipuram in Jaffna named Sangeetha Sornalingam.  She is a UK citizen now.They have a son Jason Sanjay and daughter Dhivya Sasha.\n\nVijay and Sangeetha were married ceremonially according to Hindu custom  in Chennai 27 years ago  on 25th August  1999. Before that,the couple registered their marriage formally in the UK on 10th July 1998. Sangeetha has filed for Divorce in February this year."
