    "description": "Procedural overreach in Inland Revenue 2026 Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Procedural-overreach-in-Inland-Revenue-2026-Bill/4-789903",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
