    "md5": "35f87ddbf409278df4fbe30eb2f4d060",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 571,
    "chunk_text": "Iran MP claims $ 2 m fee on ships in Hormuz\n\nAn Iranian Member of Parliament has claimed that vessels passing through the Strait of Hormuz are being charged a fee of $ 2 million, according to the BBC.\n\nAlaeddin Boroujerdi, speaking on Iranian State television, said a \u201cnew governing regime\u201d was being imposed in the strategic waterway, adding that \u201cwar has costs\u201d.\n\nHe said the move reflects the \u201cauthority and right that the Islamic Republic of Iran possesses\u201d.\n\nThe BBC said it has not been able to independently verify the claim regarding the alleged toll."
