    "description": "Vijitha Herath says Sri Lanka to fast-track Trincomalee oil tank farm redevelopment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Vijitha-Herath-says-Sri-Lanka-to-fast-track-Trincomalee-oil-tank-farm-redevelopment/56-789929",
    "lang": "en",
