    "description": "\u201cBeyond the Scars\u201d Coffee Table Book launched to raise awareness on leprosy in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/beyond-the-scars-coffee-table-book-launched-to-raise-awareness-on-leprosy-in-sri-lanka/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
