    "description": "Fossil fuel obsession, flawed advice have pushed energy security to  the brink \u2013 Dr. Vidhura Ralapanawe",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Fossil-fuel-obsession-flawed-advice-have-pushed-energy-security-to-the-brink-Dr-Vidhura-Ralapanawe/14-789955",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1774291804.0,
