    "md5": "9b0790d2e95855a8bdb1c9e305732f62",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1882,
    "chunk_text": "LAUGFS Gas announces new Board appointments\n\nLAUGFS Gas PLC has appointed Dhanusha Muthukumarana, Dr. Niroshan J. Pieries, and Eng. Nalinda Kurukulasooriya to its Board as Non-Independent Directors. Muthukumarana has also been appointed to the Board of LAUGFS Power PLC as a Non-Independent Director.\n\nDhanusha Muthukumarana serves as the Group Executive Director of LAUGFS Holdings Ltd. He is an award-winning business and technology leader with over 26 years of global experience in driving innovation-led transformation, strategic management, and sustainable growth across diverse industries including banking and finance, FMCG, manufacturing, healthcare, leisure, logistics, and technology.\n\nLeveraging Fortune 500 exposure and global enterprise leadership experience, Muthukumarana bridges corporate scale with entrepreneurial agility to drive transformation, innovation, and sustainable growth across international markets.\n\nAs the Group Executive Director and Board Director of LAUGFS Holdings Ltd., he plays a pivotal role in shaping Group-wide strategy, transformation, and performance optimisation. He also serves on the Boards of several regional and international entities, including Potenza APAC Ltd., (Singapore), Potenza ANZ Ltd., (Australia), Kasper Global Ltd., Idea Propulsion Labs Ltd., (Singapore), Serendib Frontier Capital Ltd., (Sri Lanka), and multiple subsidiaries of the LAUGFS Group.\n\nIn 2016, Muthukumarana co-founded Potenza, which has since evolved into an award-winning global technology consultancy with operations in Sri Lanka, Singapore, and Australia. The firm specialises in SAP consulting, data and analytics, and intelligent automation, delivering transformative, enterprise-grade solutions to a global client base.\n\nPrior to founding Potenza, Muthukumarana held several senior leadership roles across leading global and regional organisations."
  },
