    "chunk_text": "In addition to his corporate responsibilities, Dr. Pieries contributes to academia as a senior lecturer in management and leadership, supporting the development of future business professionals in a number of local and international institutes and universities.\n\nEng. Kurukulasooriya is an experienced corporate leader with a strong engineering background and extensive expertise in operational management, technical services, and business leadership. His professional career commenced in the automotive engineering sector, where he gained significant experience in mechanical diagnostics, fleet management, and technical service operations. Over the years, he progressed into broader managerial and leadership roles, integrating technical expertise with strategic business management.\n\nHe assumed leadership of LAUGFS Gas PLC during a particularly challenging period for the Sri Lankan energy sector, marked by the national economic crisis which placed significant pressure on the liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) industry through supply disruptions, financial constraints, and operational challenges. Under his leadership, the company successfully navigated these conditions, stabilising operations and strengthening its market position.\n\nDuring his tenure, LAUGFS Gas PLC recorded a significant improvement in performance, achieving notable growth while reinforcing operational efficiencies and customer confidence.\n\nIn recognition of his leadership and contribution to organisational transformation, he received the Global CEO Leadership Excellence Award.\n\nHe is a member of the Automobile Engineers\u2019 Association and the Institution of Incorporated Engineers Sri Lanka (IIESL)."
