    "description": "\u201cTMS\u201d :Versatile and vibrant playback singer TM Soundararajan was Hailed as the \u201cIsaich Chakkararthy\u201d(Emperor of Music).",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87526",
