    "md5": "779212436ab142045407d5c0f478f4e9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1077,
    "chunk_text": "Lee Hedges to acquire full stake in Lanka Realty Developments for Rs. 3.16 b\n\nLee Hedges PLC has announced plans to acquire the entire issued share capital of Lanka Realty Developments Ltd. (LRD) through a two-part transaction valued at over Rs. 3.16 billion.\n\nIts Board of Directors, at a meeting held on 19 March 2026, resolved to purchase 57,204,262 ordinary shares held by Lanka Realty Investments PLC (LRI), representing 51% of LRD, for a total consideration of Rs. 1,610,334,180.\n\nThe company will also acquire the remaining 49% stake in LRD held by Eighth Wonder for Rs. 1,547,183,820.\n\nUpon completion of both transactions, Lee Hedges PLC will own 100% of the issued shares of Lanka Realty Developments.\n\nThe company noted that the proposed acquisition is subject to shareholder approval by way of a special resolution. It also said the Related Party Transactions Review Committee has reviewed and approved the transaction, classifying it as a related-party transaction.\n\nLee Hedges added that an additional announcement will be made upon completion of the transaction."
  },
