    "chunk_text": "ComBank Cards offer up to 70% Avurudu discounts across the widest range of outlets island-wide\n\nThe Commercial Bank of Ceylon has launched its much-anticipated seasonal promotion for the Sinhala and Tamil New Year, offering credit and debit cardholders discounts of up to 70% across an extensive network of merchant outlets island-wide in the run-up to the Avurudu celebrations.\n\nRunning up to 30th April 2026, the annual promotion, one of the biggest highlights of the Bank\u2019s cards calendar, brings together more than 579 merchant partners representing over 4,000 retail outlets, providing Commercial Bank cardholders with a wide array of savings across multiple lifestyle categories during the festive season. As one of the Bank\u2019s most significant and welcomed annual campaigns, this promotion embodies Commercial Bank\u2019s commitment to spreading the spirit of Avurudu by bringing families and communities closer together, enabling customers to celebrate the season with greater joy, ease and generosity, while sharing in the happiness of meaningful savings across all aspects of their festive preparations.\n\nNew Anthoney\u2019s Farms marks third year at Healthy Living Expo\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
