    "md5": "7bad81bfadafdf7c20d927bfea614952",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1075,
    "chunk_text": "SLIC donates Rs. 10 m to \u2018Rebuild Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund\n\nFrom left: SLIC General CEO Dr. Sameera Dharmasena, Treasury Secretary Dr. Harshana Suriyapperuma, SLIC Chairman Nusith Kumaratunga, SLIC Life CEO Nalin Subasinghe and CFO Sriyani Kulasinghe\n\nSLIC donated Rs. 10 million to the \u2018Rebuild Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund in support of families affected by the recent \u2018Ditwah\u2019 cyclone.\n\nThe contribution was formally handed over to the Secretary to the Treasury, Dr. Harshana Suriyapperuma, at the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development on 16 March 2026. This donation will contribute towards national relief and recovery efforts aimed at assisting communities impacted by the disaster.\n\nSLIC Chairman Nusith Kumaratunga, SLIC Life CEO Nalin Subasinghe, SLIC General CEO Dr. Sameera Dharmasena, and SLIC Life CFO Sriyani Kulasinghe were present at the occasion.\n\nThrough this initiative, SLIC reaffirm their commitment to social responsibility, underscoring the importance of collective action in supporting communities and contributing to national recovery efforts."
