    "chunk_text": "In a statement the company said construction is progressing on schedule and all units advancing as planned to meet promised specifications and timelines. Designed in 2024, YOLO by Prime Group features a modern, future-ready architectural vision, seamlessly blending contemporary design with innovative elements, redefining elevated urban living.\n\nApartments begin from Rs. 35 million with a 1% monthly, 100% interest-free payment plan. The project is designed for capital appreciation and rental potential, with investors having the opportunity to achieve up to 100% return on investment, the company said."
