    "md5": "1d67813c4b5268ca254bd34ea3521583",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1798,
    "chunk_text": "Pan Asia Bank empowers export sector as Strategic Partner of NCE Export Awards\n\nPan Asia Bank reinforced its strong commitment to supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s export community through its continued partnership with the National Chamber of Exporters of Sri Lanka (NCE), as a Strategic Partner of the recently concluded prestigious NCE Export Awards.\n\nThe NCE Export Awards is the premier awards ceremony and the flagship event in the Sri Lankan business calendar conducted by NCE to recognize and reward outstanding performance of exporters. Pan Asia Bank\u2019s association with the Chamber reflects its broader vision of enabling export-led growth, strengthening global competitiveness and supporting the sustainable expansion of Sri Lankan enterprises in international markets. Pan Asia Bank recognises the importance of celebrating excellence and encouraging innovation within the sector, as exporters play a pivotal role in driving economic recovery and national prosperity,\n\nCommenting on the partnership, Director/CEO of Pan Asia Bank Naleen Edirisinghe stated: \u201cIt is a privilege to extend my warmest\u00a0congratulations\u00a0to the National Chamber of Exporters of Sri Lanka on this prestigious Awards Ceremony. As a Strategic Partner of the Chamber, Pan Asia Bank is proud to be associated with an institution that continues to be the true voice of our exporters: advocating their interests, fostering innovation and strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s presence in global trade.\u201d\n\nHe further noted that in today\u2019s dynamic global environment, the resilience, creativity and dedication of Sri Lankan exporters remain vital drivers of economic growth. Recognising their achievements not only inspires continued excellence but also underscores the critical role exports play in shaping the country\u2019s future."
