    "md5": "3ed1ecde32e3fcdf1680e6d8d0a4e06b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1698,
    "chunk_text": "Celeste & BNS partner to revolutionize Sri Lanka\u2019s quick commerce, lifestyle, and online shopping experience\n\nCeleste, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most celebrated lifestyle brands, marked a defining milestone in its journey by announcing a landmark equity partnership with the country\u2019s iconic music duo BNS. The announcement capped an evening that celebrated six years of growth, community, and the authentic connections that have come to define the Celeste brand today.\n\nDesigned as a customer-first celebration, the one-of-a-kind event brought together over 1,000 carefully selected guests from Celeste\u2019s base of more than 135,000 customers, recognising those who have consistently engaged with the brand through loyalty, frequency, and long-standing interaction. The evening gave corporate clients and long-standing patrons the opportunity to interact directly with Celeste\u2019s leadership while reflecting on the brand\u2019s journey, the customer experience it continues to build, and its future ambitions.\n\nDuring the event, Celeste formally announced an equity partnership with the iconic Sri Lankan music duo Bathiya and Santhush, widely known as BNS. Known for their groundbreaking influence on Sri Lankan music and their ability to connect with audiences across generations, Bathiya and Santhush bring both cultural star power as well as strategic business and entrepreneurial insight to the partnership.\n\nLankaPay\u2013Weixin Pay tie-up set to transform tourism receipts and digital payments landscape\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
