    "md5": "9f36f95d6a713f7d4ccdfb816953ddb0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1829,
    "chunk_text": "Canterbury Golf City is Sri Lanka\u2019s first Victorian-style golf resort apartments and residencies complex, a defining milestone in Home Lands\u2019 journey. With the addition of Canterbury Crest, Home Lands continues to meet the rising demand for residential living inside this prestigious development, building on the success of other projects within Canterbury Golf City such as Canterbury Golf Resort Apartments, Canterbury Garden Resort Apartments, Canterbury Lexus, Canterbury Golf Villas and Canterbury Golf Residencies.\u00a0 The project is symbolic of Home Lands\u2019 ability to combine scale, design excellence, and lifestyle innovation, establishing a benchmark that became a blueprint for the company\u2019s subsequent developments.\n\nCommenting on the launch, Herath said: \u201cHome Lands has once again responded to the strong demand for resort-style living within Canterbury Golf City, the first of its kind in Sri Lanka. Since its inception, Canterbury Golf City has proven to be a highly sought-after development for both homeowners and investors. With Canterbury Crest, we are proud to deliver the final phase of this development, seamlessly blending prestige with comfortable living.\u201d\n\nHome Lands has been shaping the nation\u2019s real estate landscape with a legacy built on trust, innovation, and excellence. Home Lands is the pioneer of resort-style residential developments in Sri Lanka and continues to redefine modern living, setting new benchmarks in quality, design, and lifestyle. As a fully integrated group of 14 companies, including its own construction arm, Heyraa Construction, holding the highest CS2 grading from CIDA, Home Lands delivers end-to-end solutions across real estate, construction, property management, and lifestyle creation, ensuring uncompromised quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction."
