    "description": "Defence Secretary graces India\u2013Sri Lanka Defence Industry seminar in Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Defence-Secretary-graces-IndiaSri-Lanka-Defence-Industry-seminar-in-Colombo/56-790145",
    "lang": "en",
