    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "a462529c41ed7fd4829f1b0c196b3088",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1729,
    "chunk_text": "Pointlabs Technologies launch \u2018Anya\u2019 Sri Lanka\u2019s first AI-powered voice concierge platform for Standard Chartered Priority customers\n\nFrom left: Standard Chartered Bank Head - Credit Cards and Personal Loans Tyronne Vasavan Head - Affluent Segment and Acquisition Joy De Alwis, Value Centre General Manager - Affluent and Head Wealth Management Lasitha Wijeratne,\u00a0 Head - Corporate Affairs, Brand and Marketing Kumudu Munasinghe, Executive Director and Head - Wealth and Retail Banking Chamikara Wijesinghe, Pointlabs Technologies Founder/Chief Executive Officer Dilip Devarya Samudram, Chief Technology and Innovation Officer Phanish Bhardwaj, Chief Finance Officer Anoj Silva, General Manager - South Asia Gayan De Silva\n\nPointlabs Technologies Ltd., an emerging AI-driven loyalty and engagement technology company with operating entities in the UAE and Sri Lanka, announced the launch of Sri Lanka\u2019s first AI-powered voice concierge platform for Standard Chartered Priority customers at the Hilton on Wednesday, 18 March 2026.\n\nThis first-of-its-kind solution has been designed exclusively for Standard Chartered\u2019s Priority Banking segment, redefining how affluent customers can access curated lifestyle and travel services including personalised travel recommendations, manage itineraries, and access concierge services seamlessly through AI-enabled voice interaction, transforming Premium Banking through conversational AI.\n\nThe newly launched Voice Concierge Platform enables eligible premium clients to access curated travel and lifestyle recommendations, make bookings and manage itineraries, receive real-time assistance through voice-enabled interactions and enjoy personalised, AI-driven concierge services."
  },
