    "md5": "767f0df3668dfde5fb2f2a881cfe2f7b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1654,
    "chunk_text": "The newly launched Voice Concierge Platform enables eligible premium clients to access curated travel and lifestyle recommendations, make bookings and manage itineraries, receive real-time assistance through voice-enabled interactions and enjoy personalised, AI-driven concierge services.\n\nPointlabs Technologies Ltd.\u00a0 Founder and Chief Executive Officer Dilip Devaraya Samudram said: \u201cWe are proud to introduce the region\u2019s first AI-powered voice concierge platform for Standard Chartered Priority customers. This launch demonstrates our commitment to building scalable, enterprise-grade AI solutions that enhance premium customer experiences while supporting financial institutions in their digital transformation journey.\u201d\n\nStandard Chartered Sri Lanka Executive Director and Head - Wealth and Retail Banking Chamikara Wijesinghe said: \u201cWe are pleased to bring this innovative AI-powered voice concierge developed by Pointlabs to our Priority banking clients enhancing access to personalised travel, lifestyle experiences and much more. The proposition resonated with us strongly from the outset aligning seamlessly with solutions we offer.\u201d\n\nThe Sri Lanka launch further strengthens Pointlabs\u2019 South Asian expansion strategy and represents a strategic validation of Pointlabs\u2019 scalable AI infrastructure and its ability to deliver secure, enterprise-ready solutions to global financial institutions operating in regulated environments.\n\nStandard Chartered Sri Lanka\u00a0 Executive Director and Head - Wealth and Retail Banking Chamikara Wijesinghe\n\nPointlabs Technologies Ltd.\u00a0 Founder and Chief Executive Officer Dilip Devaraya Samudram"
