    "md5": "eca94e953e3abca680057e407e6d0a76",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1343,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank launches \u201cPeople\u2019s Remittance \u2013 Kalin Avurudu Vaasi Draw 2026\u2019\u2019\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank is offering valuable gifts through People\u2019s Bank \u201cPeople\u2019s Remittance \u2013 Kalin Avurudu Vaasi Draw 2026\u201d. This special opportunity allows customers who receive foreign remittances into their People\u2019s Bank account before 31 March 2026 to win valuable gift packs in celebration of the upcoming Sinhala and Tamil New Year.\n\nFor this draw, all account holders who receive worker\u2019s remittances into their People\u2019s Bank account via People\u2019s Remittance from 1 January to 31 March 2026 will be eligible. Fifty lucky winners will be selected, each receiving a gift packs worth Rs. 25,000 containing essential and valuable goods.\n\nIn addition, customers who receive worker\u2019s remittances through People\u2019s Remittance will have the chance to win weekly cash prizes worth Rs. 100,000 through the \u201cPeople\u2019s Remittance Vaasi Kotiyai 2026\u201d draw. Furthermore, the \u201cDolosmahe Vaasi Chakraya\u201d program offers multiple chances to win prizes every month. This initiative aims not only to strengthen the country\u2019s economy but also to recognise and encourage Sri Lankan foreign workers who, with unwavering courage and dedication, support and sustain the well-being of themselves and their families, the bank said in a statement."
  },
