    "description": "LESSONS FROM MY CAREER: SYNTHESISING MANAGEMENT THEORY WITH PRACTICE \u2013 PART 34",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/lessons-from-my-career-synthesising-management-theory-with-practice-part-34/",
