    "description": "Coal for Norachcholay Plant From Indian Supplier Trident Chemiphar: Questions Raised  in power and energy circles about whose interests the  government is protecting?",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87566",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1774787400.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-03-29-dbsjeyarajcom-0845726e-0000",
