    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-39eac1dd",
    "date_str": "2026-03-29",
    "description": "Kumara  Jayakody Indicted  Over  Alleged  Corruption Charges but Why is President  Anura  Kumara  Dissanayake not taking Action Against his  Energy Minister?",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87574",
