    "chunk_text": "Russel\u2019s leverages its large-scale event expertise to secure premier sporting partnerships\n\nRussel\u2019s (Pvt) Ltd, a leading player in Sri Lanka\u2019s food and beverage sector, is demonstrating the significant commercial value of its large-scale event catering capabilities, having recently completed a major engagement at one of the country\u2019s most high-profile annual gatherings.\n\nThe company served as the official catering partner for the 92nd edition of the \u2018Battle of the Saints\u2019 cricket encounter, a three-day event held from March 19 to 21 at the Sinhalese Sports Club (SSC). The engagement saw Russel\u2019s manage the complex logistical challenge of delivering high-quality food and beverage services to thousands of attendees, including students, alumni, and other stakeholders, over the course of the event.\n\nFor Russel\u2019s, the partnership underscored the company\u2019s strategic focus on the lucrative and demanding large-scale event sector. With a business model built on extensive experience in high-volume catering, the company deployed its operational framework to ensure a seamless dining experience. Key operational priorities included maintaining rigorous standards of quality and hygiene, managing supply chain efficiency, and delivering a diverse menu capable of catering to a broad spectrum of consumer preferences under high-pressure conditions.\n\nApparel sector faces a global slowdown, JAAF undertakes quiet introspection\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
