    "chunk_size_bytes": 1910,
    "chunk_text": "This Douglas patronage somehow left out the people of Nayanmaarkattu which was home to the dreaded Pottu Amman (Shanmugalingam Sivashankar) the long-time head of the Tiger Organization Security Intelligence Service (aka TOSIS) the main intelligence wing of the LTTE from 1988 until May 2009. I recall a stone-throwing war as a cross-caste love-affaire led to the blocking of Kanagaratnam Road with tree trunks & burnt tyres in 2004.\n\nWhen the Archdeacon and Bishop allow the standing committee to entertain late submissions of accounts after the constitutionally scheduled meeting which most do not attend, why is that?\n\nCould it be for a crooked purpose to hide flaws in the accounts? Can it be sustained that the Bishop himself is straight and not crooked?\n\nThe most heinous crookedness concerning foreign funds was after the Tsunami struck on 26 Dec. 2024. Funds poured in from sympathetic westerners who had no understanding of how corrupt we are or at best lazy with no intentions of safeguarding donations from the crooks among us. It is our culture not to expose our friends who are brazen crooks. The Bishops are chief among the walls that safeguard the crooks among us.\n\nThe Jaffna Christian Union although using the word Christian, excludes the oldest Christian Church, the Roman Catholic Church established in 1580. Ironically JCU claims to stand up for social justice.\n\nWhen the tsunami struck, the JCU was well set up to rip off the funds meant for those affected. Even the wrongfully framed fiduciary mechanisms were in place to defraud us.\n\nA paid manager, by the name of Mr. Mariathasan was appointed. A non-existent shop out of Jaffna issued receipts on books certifying several millions in groceries where groceries for the destitute were \u201cbought.\u201d Cheques were signed by the treasurer Mr. Hariharan and the Rev. Jameson Gnanaponrajah (then Principal of St. John\u2019s as second signatory.)"
  },
