    "description": "Navigating Sri Lanka\u2019s new VAT refund framework: Key compliance insights",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Navigating-Sri-Lanka-s-new-VAT-refund-framework-Key-compliance-insights/4-790271",
    "lang": "en",
