    "description": "A distant war, a direct shock: What the Middle East crisis means for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/A-distant-war-a-direct-shock-What-the-Middle-East-crisis-means-for-Sri-Lanka/4-790273",
