    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "507de107583e845af01c1a338a7dae58",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 789,
    "chunk_text": "Iran, France hold telephone call to discuss US-Israeli war\n\nIranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi has discussed the security and economic consequences of the US-Israel war on Iran with his French counterpart Jean-No\u00ebl Barrot in a telephone call.\n\nBarrot \u201cemphasised\u201d France\u2019s position in \u201copposing the imposed war against Iran and attacking civilian targets,\u201d according to a statement relayed by Iran\u2019s Tasnim News Agency.\n\nHe also \u201cexpressed concern about the escalation of the situation and emphasised the need to strengthen political and diplomatic movements to find a solution to end the war and return stability and security to the region.\u201d\n\nThe two leaders also stressed the need to continue \u201cdiplomatic interactions while exchanging views on consular issues.\u201d"
  },
