    "md5": "8f4d4dd64baa3ad730202aebc7c3857e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1865,
    "chunk_text": "Singer Sri Lanka, Kapruka in strategic retail partnership through Partner Central platform\n\nSinger Sri Lanka PLC (SINS) has officially announced a strategic collaboration with Kapruka Holdings PLC (KPHL) to offer its comprehensive range of consumer electronics and homeware through the Kapruka Partner Central platform.\n\nThis partnership allows one of the nation\u2019s most trusted retail brands to leverage the digital infrastructure of Sri Lanka\u2019s largest locally owned e-commerce enterprise. By joining forces, both entities aim to streamline the online shopping experience for a diverse range of customers, ensuring that high-quality household essentials are more accessible than ever before.\n\nUnder this new arrangement, customers can browse and purchase the same high-quality Singer products found in physical showrooms with the added convenience of the Kapruka interface. A key highlight of this partnership is the price parity guarantee, where all items listed on the Kapruka platform will be sold at the exact same retail prices offered at Singer\u2019s own outlets. This ensures that shoppers receive the best value without any online premium, whether they are purchasing kitchen appliances, home entertainment systems, or other consumer durables.\n\nThe collaboration is set to provide immense value to Kapruka\u2019s extensive user base, which includes over one million expatriate customers as well as a significant local following. These shoppers will now benefit from Kapruka\u2019s renowned delivery network and personalised customer service while purchasing genuine Singer products. While the expatriate community can use the platform to reliably send essentials to their families in Sri Lanka, local residents also gain a trusted digital channel to upgrade their homes with the latest technology and furniture, backed by the reliability of both organisations."
  },
