    "chunk_text": "The collaboration is set to provide immense value to Kapruka\u2019s extensive user base, which includes over one million expatriate customers as well as a significant local following. These shoppers will now benefit from Kapruka\u2019s renowned delivery network and personalised customer service while purchasing genuine Singer products. While the expatriate community can use the platform to reliably send essentials to their families in Sri Lanka, local residents also gain a trusted digital channel to upgrade their homes with the latest technology and furniture, backed by the reliability of both organisations.\n\nRepresenting Singer Sri Lanka PLC, Chief Operating Officer Vajira Tennakoon expressed enthusiasm about the growth potential this partnership unlocks. He emphasised that as consumer behaviour shifts increasingly toward online channels, it is vital for Singer to be present where its customers are most active. Tennakoon added that by utilising Kapruka\u2019s sophisticated platform, Singer can ensure its products reach every corner of the island more efficiently, maintaining the same level of trust and service that the brand has built over decades in the retail sector while gaining access to a massive new online customer base."
