    "md5": "80ba0ff937ca7f715e915a72a1ee8d48",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 689,
    "chunk_text": "CAA raids Matara site over  tampered urea fertiliser stocks\n\nThe Consumer Affairs Authority (CAA) has uncovered a stock of urea fertiliser allegedly altered with falsified pricing information during a raid in Matara.\n\nThe operation was carried out by officials from the CAA\u2019s Matara District Office following a complaint, leading to the discovery of 179 bags of 50kg urea fertiliser at the location.\n\nAccording to the CAA, the fertiliser stocks had been tampered with, including manipulated price labels and altered product details, in preparation for sale.\n\nThe suspects along with the seized stock are due to be produced before the Matara Magistrate\u2019s Court for further legal action."
  },
