    "chunk_text": "What is needed to liberate Al Quds\n\nMasjid Al Aqsa during the last ten days of prayer last year and this year\n\nOil\u00a0 rich Arab Gulf countries are disappointed with United States for its failure to come to their rescues during the\u00a0 ongoing Iranian attacks on their countries following US-Israeli military strikes on Iran which began on 28 February 2026.\n\nAutocratic\u00a0 and oppressive Arab dictators fear they could be Israel\u2019s next target. The situation is such\u00a0 \u00a0that a Saudi official told Al Jazeera that \u201cAmerica has abandoned\u00a0 us and focused its defence\u00a0 systems on protecting Israel leaving Gulf states that host its military bases at the mercy of Iranian missiles and drones\u201d.\n\nIn the more than two and half years\u00a0 \u00a0of\u00a0 \u00a0Israeli genocide of Gaza and the indiscriminate slaughter of Palestinians\u00a0 \u00a0the Arab dictators\u00a0 \u00a0 sided with Israel and abandoned the Palestinians\u00a0 \u00a0who were to date subjected to medieval style barbarity without shelter , food\u00a0 and even water.\n\nOn the other hand these Gulf states allowed US military bases which in fact\u00a0 were Israeli\u00a0 military bases\u00a0 in their countries despite\u00a0 \u00a0extreme US-Israeli hostilities towards Arabs in the region and Muslims worldwide.\n\nThere were reports that\u00a0 in early 2026, there were significant behind-the-scenes efforts by Saudi Arabia pressing the United States to take military action against Iran, which appeared to contradict the kingdom\u2019s public stance of diplomacy .\n\nWashington Post report of 28 February 2026 titled \u201cPush\u00a0 from Saudis-Israel helped Trump to attack Iran\u201d stated as follows: President Donald Trump launched\u00a0 wide-ranging attack on Iran after\u00a0 weeks -long lobbying effort by\u00a0 Israel and Saudi Arabia . Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman made multiple private phone calls to Trump over the past month advocating a U.S. attack, despite his public support for a diplomatic solution.\u201d"
