    "chunk_text": "Washington Post report of 28 February 2026 titled \u201cPush\u00a0 from Saudis-Israel helped Trump to attack Iran\u201d stated as follows: President Donald Trump launched\u00a0 wide-ranging attack on Iran after\u00a0 weeks -long lobbying effort by\u00a0 Israel and Saudi Arabia . Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman made multiple private phone calls to Trump over the past month advocating a U.S. attack, despite his public support for a diplomatic solution.\u201d\n\nNo Muslim with an iota of self-respect and dignity would ever associate with a US president who is all out to destroy Islam and Muslims globally. Under such circumstance three rich Arab countries-Saudi Arabia, Qatar and United Arab Emirates\u00a0 rolled red carpet to receive Trump during his shameful visit last year. They spent billions to receive Trump\u00a0 while Israel continue to slaughter\u00a0 Palestinians with\u00a0 weapons supplied by Trump.\n\nIn Saudi Arabia\u00a0 Trump, treated to an escort of several Saudi F-15 fighter jets upon his arrival, announced $600 billion worth of deals, including $142 billion in arms sales.\u00a0 Qatar\u00a0 gifted\u00a0 to Trump a 400 million dollar luxury\u00a0 \u00a0plane and agreed to order up to 210 American-made Boeing 787 Dreamliner and 777x aircraft in a $96 billion deal. This is the biggest order in history, throwing the\u00a0 \u00a0embattled US jet maker a much-needed lifeline.\n\nFrom Riyadh to Abu Dhabi, a race was\u00a0 underway - not to end the genocide in Gaza, but to outspend one another for US favour. Trump\u2019s tour of Riyadh, Abu Dhabi and Doha was a theatre - staged in gold, fuelled by greed and underwritten by betrayal. Trillions were pledged; personal gifts were exchanged."
