    "md5": "9b12c804e1182f50bc3dd7bd6cb4c02e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1141,
    "chunk_text": "Lakderana Investments celebrates 20 years of growth, trust and financial resilience\n\nLakderana Investments Ltd., celebrated a significant milestone as it marked 20 years of empowering Sri Lankan individuals and businesses, reflecting on a journey of steady growth, financial resilience, and strong customer trust. The anniversary was commemorated at a grand ceremony held at Monarch Imperial on 7 March, attended by the Board of Directors, distinguished members of the banking and finance sector, business partners, and the company\u2019s dedicated workforce. Founded in 2006 with a team of just six individuals, Lakderana Investments has grown into a well-established financial services provider with 32 branches across Sri Lanka. Over the past two decades, the company has served SMEs and Micro-entrepreneurs Islandwide, supporting their working capital requirements through a range of financial products. Lakderana\u2019s services cater to multiple sectors including Agriculture, Transport, Hiring, Trading, Fisheries, Poultry, and wholesale and retail businesses, contributing to the growth of grassroots entrepreneurship and local industries."
  },
