    "description": "Consulate General\u00a0partners\u00a0Tata Group for Rebuilding Sri Lanka Initiative",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Consulate-GeneralpartnersTata-Group-for-Rebuilding-Sri-Lanka-Initiative/56-790359",
